Attribution: Berry-FCM is an independent clean-room shell reimplementation of
the privileged behavior observed in OriginOS FCM Guardian
(io.github.originosfcmguardian v1.0.0). No code from that application is
included; its safety disciplines (shell uid 2000 only, executable allowlist,
command budget, read-back verification, per-boot one-shot ledger) are
deliberately preserved.
